From: Yoonji Park <koreapyj@dcmys.kr>
Subject: ASoC: qcom: q6afe: add RT proxy port support

Add the AFE real-time (RT) proxy ports 0x2000/0x2001 to q6afe: port
configuration, shared buffer memory mapping, RT proxy driver registration
and data read/write commands, plus the RT_PROXY_PORT_001_RX/TX DAI ids.
Used by the CS voice call audio PCM (922).

Signed-off-by: Yoonji Park <koreapyj@dcmys.kr>
